    "The Guild of Harwich Artists’ Art Gallery at 551 Main Street, Harwich Port, will be open during the annual holiday stroll on December 6th, 4-8:00 pm. In addition to featuring 24 artists the gallery will be selling our popular hand-painted miniature holiday ornaments. Proceeds to benefit two local children’s funds. The ornaments, many featuring holidays on the Cape, are great stocking stuffers."
